#. module: account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The move (%s) is not balanced.\n"
"The total of debits equals %s and the total of credits equals %s.\n"
"You might want to specify a default account on journal \"%s\" to automatically balance each move."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Ez da mugimendua (%s) ordaindu.\n"
"Zorraren zenbatekoa %s da eta kredituaren zenbatekoa %s da.\n"
"'%s' egunkarian kontu lehenetsi bat zehaztea gomendatzen dizugu mugimendu bakoitza automatikoki ordaintzeko."

#. module: account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account.field_account_tax__amount_type
msgid ""
"\n"
"    - Group of Taxes: The tax is a set of sub taxes.\n"
"    - Fixed: The tax amount stays the same whatever the price.\n"
"    - Percentage of Price: The tax amount is a % of the price:\n"
"        e.g 100 * (1 + 10%) = 110 (not price included)\n"
"        e.g 110 / (1 + 10%) = 100 (price included)\n"
"    - Percentage of Price Tax Included: The tax amount is a division of the price:\n"
"        e.g 180 / (1 - 10%) = 200 (not price included)\n"
"        e.g 200 * (1 - 10%) = 180 (price included)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- Zerga-taldea: zerga azpi-zerga multzo bat da.\n"
"    - Finkoa: prezioa aldatzen bada ere, zergaren zenbatekoa berdin mantentzen da.\n"
"    - Prezioaren ehunekoa: zergaren zenbatekoa prezioaren % da:\n"
"        adb. 100 * (1 + % 10) = 110 (prezioa aparte)\n"
"        adb. 110 / (1 + % 10) = 100 (prezioa barne)\n"
"    - Prezioaren ehunekoa, zergak barne: zergen zenbatekoa prezioaren zatiketa bat da:\n"
"        adb. 180 / (1 - % 10) = 200 (prezioa aparte)\n"
"        adb. 200 * (1- % 10) =  180  (prezioa barne)\n"
"       "

